        │
        ▼
AGENT ORCHESTRATOR
        │
        ▼
TOOLS / ENVIRONMENTS / SERVICES
        │
        ▼
OBSERVATION & TELEMETRY
        │
        ▼
VERIFICATION / EVALUATION
        │
        ├──────────────► SUCCESS → INTEGRATE
        │
